    { "text": "工具袋每個掛位都注視過（逐格），且 工具袋 5–9 號都在袋", "rule": "env.tool_bag.slot_5.viewed&&env.tool_bag.slot_6.viewed&&env.tool_bag.slot_7.viewed&&env.tool_bag.slot_8.viewed&&env.tool_bag.slot_9.viewed&&rack.slot_5=on_rack&&rack.slot_6=on_rack&&rack.slot_7=on_rack&&rack.slot_8=on_rack&&rack.slot_9=on_rack", "owner": "b4:p5" },
    { "text": "零件袋與台架旁 L、R 螺栓盤都是空的，待報廢箱有 2 條舊滑板（CSR_05 判合格時為 0），車頂無遺留", "rule": "env.tool_bag.bolt_pouch.count<=0&&env.bolt_tray_L.count<=0&&env.bolt_tray_R.count<=0&&env.parts_tray.strip_count_ok&&roof.leftover_count<=0", "owner": "b4:p5" },
    { "text": "兩個螺栓盤、零件袋、暫放墊都空，車頂沒有遺留螺栓或滑板", "rule": "env.bolt_tray_L.count<=0&&env.bolt_tray_R.count<=0&&env.tool_bag.bolt_pouch.count<=0&&env.roof_strip_mat.count<=0&&roof.leftover_count<=0", "owner": "b4:p5" },
    { "text": "已確認", "target": "env.work_order.toolcount_confirm", "rule": "workorder.toolcount_confirmed" },
    { "text": "已確認", "target": "env.work_order.toolcount_confirm_platform", "rule": "workorder.toolcount_platform_confirmed", "owner": "b4:p5" },
    { "text": "工具架 slot_11、12（slot_1 掛牌組在腰包、slot_4 安全帶穿在身上，WC_06 c 歸還） 與桿架 slot_2、3 都在架", "rule": "rack.slot_11=on_rack&&rack.slot_12=on_rack&&rack.slot_2=on_rack&&rack.slot_3=on_rack" },
    { "text": "桿架 2、3 號都在架", "rule": "rack.slot_2=on_rack&&rack.slot_3=on_rack" },
    { "text": "吊鉤在停放位置", "rule": "part.crane.hook.parked", "owner": "b4:p4" },
    { "text": "power = false，遙控器 = 在掛座", "rule": "ctrl.crane.power=false&&env.crane_pendant.state=Docked" },
